            "sid": "DEU 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Moses had finished writing the words of this law in a book, to the very end, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses commanded the Levites who carried the ark of the covenant of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Take this book of the law, and put it by the side of the ark of the covenant of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God, that it may be there for a witness against you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I know how rebellious and stubborn you are; behold, while I am yet alive with you, today you have been rebellious against the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; how much more after my death! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Assemble to me all the elders of your tribes, and your officers, that I may speak these words in their ears and call heaven and earth to witness against them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I know that after my death you will surely act corruptly, and turn aside from the way which I have commanded you; and in the days to come evil will befall you, because you will do what is evil in the sight of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", provoking him to anger through the work of your hands.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
